# Build context for v2/Dockerfile is the repository root. Everything is left
# out except what the pixdcon2 image copies (an allow-list, matrix A-158).
*

!v2/package.json
!v2/package-lock.json
!v2/src
!v2/web

!lib/pixoo-image.js
!lib/pixoo-font.js
!lib/collectors
!scenes
!assets
!version.json
!vendor/inspr-versioning

# Never part of an image: runtime state the scenes write next to themselves.
scenes/**/.state
**/node_modules
